# Implementation Plan: Restoring & Professionalizing Sayqallash (Polishing) Engine

The goal is to restore the "Sayqallash" functionality as a high-precision, 3-tier correction engine that provides visual feedback (Red X / Green Check) and improves through self-learning.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> The "Sayqallash" engine will now strictly follow this priority order:
> 1. **Tier 1 (Database Rules)**: Exact matches from the dictionary of established corrections.
> 2. **Tier 2 (Claude AI)**: Using `claude-sonnet-4-20250514` for complex linguistic analysis of regions not covered by rules.
> 3. **Tier 3 (BERT Fallback)**: Semantic search for potential corrections using the BERT vector engine.

> [!WARNING]
> The current `/improve-row` endpoint will be refactored to use the unified `Sayqallash` logic to ensure consistent behavior across the Dashboard.

